{"strongs": "H7565", "word": "רֶ֫שֶׁף", "translit": "re.sheph", "root": "רשף", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "flame, fire-bolt", "definition": "I. רֶ֫שֶׁף noun masculine Hab 3:5 flame, fire-bolt ; — absolute ׳ ר Deut 32:24 +; plural רְשָׁפִים Ps 78:48 , construct ׳ רִשְׁפֵ Ps 76:4 , רִשְׁפֵּי Song 8:6 suffix רְשֶׁפֶיהָ v Song 8:6 — 1. flame: אֵשׁ ׳ ר ׳ ר Song 8:6 its flames (that is of אַהֲבָה , קִנְאָה ) are flames of fire ; ׳ בְּנֵי ר Job 5:7 = sparks ; ׳ ר = pointed flame of lighting Ps 78:48 (|| בָּרָד ); קָ֑שֶׁת ׳ ר Ps 76:4 Sharp flames of the bow , figurative for arrows. 2. fire-bolt of ׳ יְ brining pestilence and death, Deut 32:24 (compare Dr ; || קֶטֶב מְרִירִי ), Hab 3:5 (|| דֶּבֶר ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8130')\">BDB8130</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7565')\">H7565</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8129')\">BDB8129</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8131')\">BDB8131</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>רֶ֫שֶׁף</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Hab 3:5\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,5)\">Hab 3:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>flame, fire-bolt</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,24)\">Deut 32:24</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>רְשָׁפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:48\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,48)\">Ps 78:48</ref>, construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רִשְׁפֵ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 76:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,4)\">Ps 76:4</ref>, <bdbheb>רִשְׁפֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 8:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,6)\">Song 8:6</ref> suffix <bdbheb>רְשֶׁפֶיהָ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Song 8:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,6)\">Song 8:6</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>flame:</highlight> <bdbheb>אֵשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 8:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,6)\">Song 8:6</ref> <highlight>its flames</highlight> (that is of <bdbheb>אַהֲבָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>קִנְאָה</bdbheb>) <highlight>are flames of fire</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּנֵי ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,7)\">Job 5:7</ref> = <highlight>sparks</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> = <highlight>pointed flame</highlight> of lighting <ref ref=\"Ps 78:48\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,48)\">Ps 78:48</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בָּרָד</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>קָ֑שֶׁת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 76:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,4)\">Ps 76:4</ref> Sharp <highlight>flames of the bow</highlight>, figurative for arrows. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>fire-bolt</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְ</bdbheb> brining pestilence and death, <ref ref=\"Deut 32:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,24)\">Deut 32:24</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; || <bdbheb>קֶטֶב מְרִירִי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Hab 3:5\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,5)\">Hab 3:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>דֶּבֶר</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hab 3:5", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut 32:24", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 32, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Ps 78:48", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 78, "verse": 48}, {"raw": "Ps 76:4", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 76, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Song 8:6", "book": "SNG", "chapter": 8, "verse": 6